+### Requirement: Hostile keys are handled as plain data
+Members named `__proto__` (or `constructor`, `toString`) SHALL be treated as ordinary data members, both in the patch and in the target, and SHALL NOT modify any prototype. Only own members of `target` SHALL be considered when merging.
